copied from Taskmaster (Commons Clause) or spec-workflow-mcp (GPL-3.0). The
design spec, docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-29-prd-toolkit-design.md section 1
("Prior art and what is borrowed"), lists what was taken and what was declined.

Each copyright line below is copied from that project's own LICENSE file,
except Anthropic's, which is marked inferred where it stands.

